   "text": "Many ellipses touch all four walls. [pause 0.2] The correlation picks one. Correlation r means one standard deviation to the right, on average r standard deviations up. That's the best-fit line, through the middle of every vertical slice. At the wall, the slice is just the touch point, r times ess why above the center. For the dinosaur, it's just below the middle.",
